def stable_unique(items):
    result = []
    for item in items:
        if item not in result:
            result.append(item)
    return result
```
List membership uses equality, so this accepts unhashable values and preserves first occurrences. It uses O(n) result memory and O(n^2) equality comparisons in the worst case.
